#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:420
msgid ""
"Some books have very wide content that cannot be broken up at page "
"boundaries. For example tables or :code:`<pre>` tags. In such cases, you "
"should switch the viewer to *flow mode* by pressing :kbd:`Ctrl+M` to read "
"this content. Alternately, you can also add the following CSS to the "
":guilabel:`Styles` section of the viewer preferences to force the viewer to "
"break up lines of text in :code:`<pre>` tags::"
msgstr "Niektoré knihy majú veľmi široký obsah, ktorý sa nedá rozdeliť na hraniciach stránok. Napríklad tabuľky alebo značky :code:`<pre>`. V takých prípadoch by ste mali prepnúť prehliadač do *plynulého režimu* stlačením :kbd:`Ctrl+M`, aby ste tento obsah prečítali. Prípadne môžete do sekcie :guilabel:`Štýly` v nastaveniach prehliadača pridať nasledujúce CSS, ktoré prinúti prehliadač rozdeliť riadky textu v značkách :code:`<pre>`::"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:431
msgid "Designing your book to work well with the calibre E-book viewer"
msgstr "Navrhovanie knihy tak, aby dobre fungovala s prehliadačom e-kníh calibre"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:433
msgid ""
"The calibre E-book viewer will set the ``is-calibre-viewer`` class on the "
"root element. So you can write CSS rules that apply only for it. "
"Additionally, the viewer will set the following classes on the ``body`` "
"element:"
msgstr "Prehliadač e-kníh calibre nastaví triedu ``is-calibre-viewer`` na koreňovom prvku. Môžete teda písať pravidlá CSS, ktoré platia iba preň. Okrem toho prehliadač nastaví na prvku ``body`` nasledujúce triedy:"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:437
msgid "``body.calibre-viewer-dark-colors``"
msgstr "``body.calibre-viewer-dark-colors``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:438
msgid "Set when using a dark color scheme"
msgstr "Nastaví sa pri použití tmavej farebnej schémy"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:440
msgid "``body.calibre-viewer-light-colors``"
msgstr "``body.calibre-viewer-light-colors``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:441
msgid "Set when using a light color scheme"
msgstr "Nastaví sa pri použití svetlej farebnej schémy"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:443
msgid "``body.calibre-viewer-paginated``"
msgstr "``body.calibre-viewer-paginated``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:444
msgid "Set when in paged mode"
msgstr "Nastaví sa v stránkovom režime"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:446
msgid "``body.calibre-viewer-scrolling``"
msgstr "``body.calibre-viewer-scrolling``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:447
msgid "Set when in flow (non-paginated) mode"
msgstr "Nastaví sa v plynulom (nestránkovom) režime"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:449
msgid "``body.calibre-footnote-container``"
msgstr "``body.calibre-footnote-container``"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:450
msgid "Set when displaying a popup footnote"
msgstr "Nastaví sa pri zobrazovaní vyskakovacej poznámky pod čiarou"

#: ../../../__w/calibre/calibre/manual/viewer.rst:452
msgid ""
"Finally, you can use the calibre color scheme colors via `CSS variables "
"<https://developer.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/docs/Web/CSS/Using_CSS_custom_properties>`_. The calibre E-book viewer "
"defines the following variables: ``--calibre-viewer-background-color``, "
"``--calibre-viewer-foreground-color`` and optionally ``--calibre-viewer-"
"link-color`` in color themes that define a link color."
msgstr "Nakoniec môžete farby farebnej schémy calibre používať prostredníctvom `premenných CSS <https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Using_CSS_custom_properties>`_. Prehliadač e-kníh calibre definuje nasledujúce premenné: ``--calibre-viewer-background-color``, ``--calibre-viewer-foreground-color`` a voliteľne ``--calibre-viewer-link-color`` vo farebných témach, ktoré definujú farbu odkazu."
